Section Seg3.
  Variables (sp gp tp t0 t1 t2 a1 a2 a4 a5 a6 a7 s10 s11 t3 t4 t5 t6 : word) (F : bvmap 5 word) (fc : bv 32) (m : mem).
  Variables (s0 s1 s2 s3 s4 s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 ra stat s4v rax : word) (j8 : list byte) (jslot : word).
  Variables (lo size msz a pa PS BSL nresv nch : Z) (chunks : list Z).
  Hypothesis MI : mem_inv bsegs m.
  Hypothesis ST : stk bsegs m lo (bv_unsigned sp + -96).
  Hypothesis LO : aceil <= lo.  Hypothesis HI : lo + 416 <= bv_unsigned sp.
  Hypothesis SZ : 0x10000 < size /\ size <= 2^41. Hypothesis MSZ : size + 4096 <= msz /\ msz < size + 8192.
  Hypothesis AR : aapp a msz /\ a + msz <= aceil.
  Hypothesis PAR : aapp pa kPtrArrayReserve /\ pa + kPtrArrayReserve <= aceil.
  Hypothesis NCH : 0 <= nch < nresv /\ nresv <= 2^20. Hypothesis LEN : zlen chunks = nch.
  Hypothesis PSE : PS = pa + 8 * nch.
  Hypothesis BSLE : BSL = 1221120 + 8 * Z.log2 msz.
  Hypothesis PLC : hidden (a + msz <= pa \/ pa + kPtrArrayReserve <= a).
  Hypothesis STAT : stat = wz (AINST + 688).
  Hypothesis FR : laframe sp s0 s1 s2 s3 s4 s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 ra m j8.
  Hypothesis INST64 : rw_cells bsegs m 1221016 [C8 (wz 4096); C8 (wz pa); C8 (wz pa)].
  Hypothesis NRES : rw_cells bsegs m 1221064 [C8 (wz nresv); C8 (wz nch); C8 (wz 0)].
  Hypothesis SST : stk bsegs m 1221088 1221632.
  Hypothesis MTX : rw_cells bsegs m 1221632 [C4 (wz 1); C4 (wz 0)].
  Hypothesis GST : stk bsegs m 1221640 1221680.
  Hypothesis PA : u64arr bsegs m pa (wlist chunks).
  Hypothesis SLOT : rw_cells bsegs m PS [C8 jslot].
  Hypothesis HDR : rw_cells bsegs m a [C8 (wz a); C8 (wz msz); C8 (wz size)].
  Hypothesis HDR2 : stk bsegs m (a + 24) (a + 4096).

  Let ARE : 6832128 <= a /\ a + msz <= aceil. Proof. exact (aapp_env _ _ (proj1 AR) ltac:(lia)). Qed.   (* [comment removed for export] *)
  Let PAE : 6832128 <= pa /\ pa + kPtrArrayReserve <= aceil. Proof. exact (aapp_env _ _ (proj1 PAR) ltac:(clear; hci; unfold kPtrArrayReserve; lia)). Qed.
